@startuml LLM_Request_Orchestration
!theme aws-orange
title LLM Request Orchestration: Smart Routing + Caching + Function Calling
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam roundcorner 20

actor User as U
participant "Smart Routing\nController" as SRC
participant "Prompt Cache\nController" as PCC
participant "RAG Prompt\nAssembly" as RPA
participant "Multimodal\nReasoning Agent" as MRA
participant "Structured\nPlanning Agent" as SPA
participant "Function Calling\nAgent" as FCA
database "Redis Cache" as RC
database "Vector DB" as VDB
database "Neo4j" as NEO
control "OpenAI GPT-4V" as GPT4V
control "OpenAI GPT-4" as GPT4
control "Claude-3.5" as CLAUDE

U -> SRC : User Request\n"Add milk to shopping cart"

SRC -> SRC : Analyze Request Complexity\ncomplexity_score = 0.6

note right of SRC
**Complexity Analysis:**
• Text complexity: 0.3 (simple instruction)
• Visual requirements: 0.8 (GUI interaction)
• Business logic: 0.7 (e-commerce domain)
• **Final score: 0.6** (medium complexity)
end note

SRC -> PCC : Check Cached Response\nprompt_hash + context_hash
PCC -> RC : Query Cache\n"prompt_cache:{hash1}:{hash2}"
RC --> PCC : Cache Miss
PCC --> SRC : No Cached Response

SRC -> RPA : Assemble RAG-Enhanced Prompt\nquery + context
RPA -> VDB : Semantic Search\n"shopping cart patterns"
VDB --> RPA : Similar Patterns (5 results)
RPA -> NEO : Graph Traversal\n"product → cart relationships"
NEO --> RPA : Business Rules & Constraints

RPA -> RPA : Compress Context\n3000 → 1500 tokens (50% reduction)

note right of RPA
**Context Compression Example:**
- Retrieved patterns: 1200 → 600 tokens
- Business rules: 800 → 400 tokens
- Current context: 1000 → 500 tokens
- **Total: 3000 → 1500 tokens**
end note

RPA --> SRC : RAG-Enhanced Prompt\n+ Compressed Context

SRC -> SRC : Route Based on Complexity\nScore 0.6 → Multi-Agent Workflow

par Multi-Agent Processing
  SRC -> MRA : Visual Analysis Request\n+ Screenshot + Business Context
  MRA -> GPT4V : Multimodal Analysis\nStructured Output Request
  GPT4V --> MRA : Structured Visual Analysis
  MRA --> SRC : Visual Understanding Result

  SRC -> SPA : Request Structured Plan\nwith RAG + Visual Context
  SPA -> GPT4 : Generate Action Plan\n(Structured Output)
  GPT4 --> SPA : JSON Plan\n{steps, dependencies}
  SPA --> SRC : Structured Plan
end

SRC -> FCA : Execute Functions\nbased on Plan
FCA -> CLAUDE : Validate Plan Steps\n(explainability)
CLAUDE --> FCA : Validated Plan

alt Function Calls
  FCA -> "E-commerce API" : add_to_cart(product="milk", qty=1)
  "E-commerce API" --> FCA : {status: "success", cart_id: 987}
end

FCA --> SRC : Function Call Result

SRC -> GPT4 : Final Response Generation\nw/ Context + Results
GPT4 --> SRC : Natural Language Answer

SRC -> PCC : Store in Cache\n"prompt_cache:{hash1}:{hash2}" → response
PCC -> RC : Save Cached Response
RC --> PCC : OK

SRC --> U : "Milk has been added to your cart ✅"

note over SPA
📄 **Structured Plan Example:**
```json
{
  "steps": [
    {"id": 1, "action": "detect_ui", "target": "shopping_cart"},
    {"id": 2, "action": "locate_product", "target": "milk"},
    {"id": 3, "action": "function_call", "api": "add_to_cart", "params": {"product": "milk", "qty": 1}}
  ],
  "dependencies": [[2,3]]
}
````

end note

note over FCA
⚙️ **Function Call Schema:**

```json
{
  "name": "add_to_cart",
  "parameters": {
    "type": "object",
    "properties": {
      "product": {"type": "string"},
      "qty": {"type": "integer"}
    },
    "required": ["product", "qty"]
  }
}
```

end note

note over PCC
🗄️ **Cache Storage Example:**
Key: `prompt_cache:d41d8cd:ab56b4d`
Value:

```json
{
  "query": "Add milk to shopping cart",
  "context": "E-commerce session #123",
  "response": "Milk has been added to your cart ✅",
  "timestamp": "2025-09-25T12:00:00Z"
}
```

TTL: 2 minutes
end note

@enduml
